  "editorial": {
    "name": "ColorBrewer 2.0",
    "descriptionZh": "ColorBrewer 2.0 是 Cynthia Brewer 等给地图配色的在线工具：按数据类型从 sequential、diverging、qualitative 三类里挑方案，再筛色盲安全与打印友好。",
    "takeawayZh": "给地图挑一套色盲安全配色，再导出 ASE 或 CSS",
    "noteZh": "首屏左边是一整列控制面板：最上面 Number of data classes 下拉停在 3，下面 Nature of your data 三个单选 sequential / diverging / qualitative，Pick a color scheme 里 Multi-hue 与 Single-hue 两栏色卡并排，Only show 下是 colorblind safe、print friendly、photocopy safe 三个复选框，Context 里勾着 borders，Background 选的是 solid color，最下面还有一根 color transparency 滑杆。面板右侧的代码框选了 3-class BuGn，列出 #e5f5f9、#99d8c9、#2ca25f 三个色值，旁边一块竖排的 EXPORT 按钮；右边整块是染成绿色的美国县级地图。页脚写 © Cynthia Brewer, Mark Harrower and The Pennsylvania State University，并留着 Back to ColorBrewer 1.0 与 Source code and feedback 的入口。",
    "recommendation": null,
    "pricing": "Free",
    "pricingNote": null
  },
